could create a new species that is blue only intelligent, but also is created with a wealth of memories and experiences to match the sorcerer. To me, such a working would be at the level of Celestial.","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/>Check out my homebrew exalt: The Fabulists - Chosen of the Raksha <a href=\"http://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/exalted/1141861-peach-new-exalt-splat-the-fabulist-exalts-chosen-of-the-raksha\" target=\"_blank\">here</a>","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[{"type":"\ud83d\udc4d","count":1}],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/8804-armyofwhispers","name":"armyofwhispers","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar8804_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":0,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Oct 2015"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"790"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2019-03-22T12:48:44-07:00","id":1298708,"title":"","content":"<div class=\"bbcode_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote\"> <div class=\"quote_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote_container b-icon b-icon__ldquo-l--gray\"></div> <div class=\"bbcode_postedby\"> Originally posted by <strong>armyofwhispers</strong> <a href=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/exalted/1298457-sidebar-on-transgender-dynasts?p=1298702#post1298702\" rel=\"nofollow\" title=\"View Post\" class=\"b-icon b-icon__double-arrow-right--blue animate-scroll\">View Post</a> </div> <div class=\"message\"><br /> As has been mentioned, terrestrial workings can do the same as modern gender reassignment surgery can. This isn't that complicated.<br /> <br /> To me the difference is this:<br /> <br /> Terrestrial Ambition sorcery can create a completely new mundane species. It can add stuff in to an existing specimen.<br /> <br /> What you need Celestial circle for us completely rewriting a person's chromosomes to change their gender at a fundamental level while also preserving their memories and personality intact.<br /> <br /> I have never seen anyone claim that terrestrial circle sorcery could create a new species that is blue only intelligent, but also is created with a wealth of memories and experiences to match the sorcerer. To me, such a working would be at the level of Celestial.</div> </div> </div> </div>That makes no sense because ambition 3 can be used to make things whole cloth and breed true. This is explicitly in contrast of the examples given.<br /> <br /> Edit- Also, Celestial circle sorcery lets you create Demons of the second circle, humans and other non-magical animals are flatly in the terrestial level. You can also use terrestrial sorcery to breed humans with magical beings. The term mundane was broad and implicating.","signature":"","edited":{"userid":116,"user_link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/116-epimetheus","user":"Epimetheus","date":". 03-22-2019, 03:58 PM"},"attachments":[],"reactions":[{"type":"\ud83d\udc4d","count":1}],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/116-epimetheus","name":"Epimetheus","avatar":"data:image/svg+xml;base64,","title":"Member","rank":0,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"1758"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2019-03-22T12:58:41-07:00","id":1298713,"title":"","content":"<div class=\"bbcode_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote\"> <div class=\"quote_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote_container b-icon b-icon__ldquo-l--gray\"></div> <div class=\"bbcode_postedby\"> Originally posted by <strong>Epimetheus</strong> <a href=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/exalted/1298457-sidebar-on-transgender-dynasts?p=1298708#post1298708\" rel=\"nofollow\" title=\"View Post\" class=\"b-icon b-icon__double-arrow-right--blue animate-scroll\">View Post</a> </div> <div class=\"message\">That makes no sense because ambition 3 can be used to make things whole cloth and breed true. This is explicitly in contrast of the examples given.</div> </div> </div> </div>Okay, you've missed my point. <br /> <br /> See it's more than just make a new thing that needs true. It's &quot;make a new thing that breeds true that also has the personality, memories and all other traits of another person.<br /> <br /> Edit. So I'd allow someone to fully reshape a human into another gender with all that implies with a terrestrial 3 working. I'd just say that this completely wipes out their memories and personality and any exaltation they have gets removed","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/>Check out my homebrew exalt: The Fabulists - Chosen of the Raksha <a href=\"http://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/exalted/1141861-peach-new-exalt-splat-the-fabulist-exalts-chosen-of-the-raksha\" target=\"_blank\">here</a>","edited":{"userid":8804,"user_link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/8804-armyofwhispers","user":"armyofwhispers","date":". 03-22-2019, 04:01 PM"},"attachments":[],"reactions":[{"type":"\ud83d\udc4d","count":1}],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/8804-armyofwhispers","name":"armyofwhispers","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar8804_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":0,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Oct 2015"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"790"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2019-03-22T13:05:19-07:00","id":1298716,"title":"","content":"<div class=\"bbcode_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote\"> <div class=\"quote_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote_container b-icon b-icon__ldquo-l--gray\"></div> <div class=\"bbcode_postedby\"> Originally posted by <strong>armyofwhispers</strong> <a href=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/exalted/1298457-sidebar-on-transgender-dynasts?p=1298713#post1298713\" rel=\"nofollow\" title=\"View Post\" class=\"b-icon b-icon__double-arrow-right--blue animate-scroll\">View Post</a> </div> <div class=\"message\">Edit. So I'd allow someone to fully reshape a human into anoth